  "historyNote": "#8085, eff 5-26-04; amd by #9720-A, eff 6-5-10, (paras (a) & (e)-(i)); amd by #9720-B, eff 6-5-10, (paras (b)-(d)); ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13644, eff 6-1-23",
